From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 03:33:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] soc: amlogic: meson-gx-socinfo: add GXLX2 and S905L3 IDs

The S905L3 reports major ID 0x2a, which the table skips between G12B and
SM1, so the SoC registers as "Unknown (Unknown)". Add the family, and the
S905L3 as its only known part, matching any package as the S905L does.

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
---
--- a/drivers/soc/amlogic/meson-gx-socinfo.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/amlogic/meson-gx-socinfo.c
@@ -39,6 +39,7 @@
 	{ "TXHD", 0x27 },
 	{ "G12A", 0x28 },
 	{ "G12B", 0x29 },
+	{ "GXLX2", 0x2a },
 	{ "SM1", 0x2b },
 	{ "A1", 0x2c },
 	{ "T7", 0x36 },
@@ -77,6 +78,7 @@
 	{ "S905X2", 0x28, 0x40, 0xf0 },
 	{ "A311D", 0x29, 0x10, 0xf0 },
 	{ "S922X", 0x29, 0x40, 0xf0 },
+	{ "S905L3", 0x2a, 0, 0x0 },
 	{ "S905D3", 0x2b, 0x4, 0xf5 },
 	{ "S905X3", 0x2b, 0x5, 0xf5 },
 	{ "S905X3", 0x2b, 0x10, 0x3f },
